There are text screens (screens as in 'windows' in your operating 
environment, not as in text-only physical terminals) that let you use 
monospaced vector-based fonts, rather than only raster fonts.
An example is the command prompt UI in recent versions of MS Windows.

Lucida Console is very nice font for this IMHO.

